# 8. `.gitignore`

Create **`.gitignore`**:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Streamlit
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log
